!/docs/security.md
!/docs/seo-launch.md
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.log
**/*.sql
**/*.sqlite*
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/node_modules/
**/vendor/
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
